# Source and documentation normalise to LF in the repository.
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.cff   text eol=lf

# Result artefacts are provenance records, not editable text. results/RUN_LOG.md
# records a SHA-256 for each of these files, and a reader is expected to check
# the published bytes against it. Any end-of-line rewriting changes those bytes
# and breaks every recorded digest, so Git must store them verbatim.
# These rules come last deliberately: later patterns win.
results/tables/**   -text
results/figures/**  -text
